      "extract": "The discovery of the knot solutions of Maxwell's equations in the vacuum represents one of the most exciting results obtained recently in the modern classical electrodynamics. Since their first appearance in the seminal papers \\cite{Trautman:1977im,Ranada:1989wc,Ranada:1990,Ranada:1992hw}, many interesting properties, applications, and generalizations of the knot electromagnetic fields have been discovered. The knot",
