      "extract": "In this section, we are going to review the field line solutions of Maxwell's equations and their relationship with the Hopf knots. These solutions were discovered by Ra\\~{n}ada and were communicated in \\cite{Ranada:1989wc,Ranada:1990}. An important study of the Hopf fibration in the context of the classical electromagnetism can be found in the early pioneering work by Trautman \\cite{Trautman:1977im}. In our",
