      "extract": "The Ran\\~{a}da solutions form a particular class of \\emph{field line solutions} whose main feature is that the field lines completly characterize the electromagnetic field. In general, one can associate a field line to any smooth vector field through its integral flow. The path formed by the field line is tangent in each of its points to the vector obtained by taking the value of the vector field at that point. The",
